@AuctionApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5077

### Создать аукцион без фото
POST {{AuctionApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auctions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AuctionBoundary

--AuctionBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ProductName"

Винтажные часы
--AuctionBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="StartsAt"

2026-11-01T10:00:00+03:00
--AuctionBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="EndsAt"

2026-11-08T10:00:00+03:00
--AuctionBoundary--
